s will be failed? Later we'll need to explain how it works with OoP modules as well","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/comments/3672831317/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/comments/3672832788","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/131#issuecomment-3672832788","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/131","id":3672832788,"node_id":"IC_kwDOPaLyBs7a6vsU","user":{"login":"Artifizer","id":192502778,"node_id":"U_kgDOC3lb-g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/192502778?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer","html_url":"https://github.com/Artifizer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-19T00:15:36Z","updated_at":"2025-12-19T00:15:36Z","body":"Let's also update example to illustrate how to define own callbacks","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/comments/3672832788/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/comments/3672849648","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/131#issuecomment-3672849648","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/131","id":3672849648,"node_id":"IC_kwDOPaLyBs7a6zzw","user":{"login":"Artifizer","id":192502778,"node_id":"U_kgDOC3lb-g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/192502778?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer","html_url":"https://github.com/Artifizer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-19T00:23:15Z","updated_at":"2025-12-19T00:53:06Z","body":"I think the whole start flow should be adjusted to:\r\n\r\n1. For every system module:\r\n- run all pre_init's\r\n- run all migrations\r\n- run all init()\r\n- run all post_init()\r\n\r\n2. Then, for every user module do the same:\r\n- run all pre_init's\r\n- run all migrations\r\n- run all init()\r\n- run all post_init()\r\n...\r\n\r\nMaybe even have more \"layers\" ...\r\n\r\nIt would allow system modules to be fully ready to serve user modules, we can make an analogy between OS start and App start on top of the OS. Or modules start within kernel or initd","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https:/