ssociation":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/comments/3667972952/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/comments/3669247822","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/128#issuecomment-3669247822","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/128","id":3669247822,"node_id":"IC_kwDOPaLyBs7atEdO","user":{"login":"Bechma","id":19294519,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5Mjk0NTE5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19294519?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma","html_url":"https://github.com/Bechma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-18T09:12:24Z","updated_at":"2025-12-18T09:12:24Z","body":"> I believe we need to make throttling :\r\n> \r\n> * global\r\n> * per tenant\r\n> \r\n> both must be in place, first - not to kill DB or service, second - to isolate noisy tenant\r\n\r\nWe need to define how the throttling will affect maybe:\r\n- Global means throttling by its IP?\r\n- Per tenant means by the user token?\r\n\r\nI added the requested headers to make the API standard and backward compatible, but we are throttling per method|route and that's a global that don't apply per user.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/comments/3669247822/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/comments/3675806258","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/128#issuecomment-3675806258","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/128","id":3675806258,"node_id":"IC_kwDOPaLyBs7bGFoy","user":{"login":"MikeFalcon77","id":3686170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2ODYxNzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3686170?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77","html_url":"https://github.com/MikeFalcon77","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-19T16:55:28Z","updated_at":"2025-12-19T16:55:39Z","body":"> * Global means throttling by its IP?\r\n> * Per tenant means by the user token?\r\nI suggest to use well-known throttling model. I will send PM with a link to ADN.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/iss