","id":248559081,"node_id":"U_kgDODtC16Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/248559081?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyphen-2025","html_url":"https://github.com/hyphen-2025","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyphen-2025/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyphen-2025/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyphen-2025/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyphen-2025/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyphen-2025/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyphen-2025/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyphen-2025/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyphen-2025/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyphen-2025/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Motivation\r\n\r\nCloses #112 \r\n\r\n- **Reduce auth bugs from string literals**: `require_auth(\"users\", \"read\")` is easy to mistype and hard to refactor safely.\r\n- **Tighten the auth requirements API contract**\r\n\r\n## Summary of changes\r\n\r\n- **Breaking API change (ModKit)**\r\n  - `OperationBuilder::require_auth` now accepts:\r\n    -  strongly typed resource\r\n    - strongly typed action\r\n  - Introduced `AuthReqResource` / `AuthReqAction` traits (string conversion via `as_str()`).\r\n \r\n- **Docs/examples/tests updated**\r\n  - Updated `docs/MODKIT_UNIFIED_SYSTEM.md` and `guidelines/NEW_MODULE.md` to the new `require_auth(&Resource::X, &Action::Y)` style.\r\n  - Updated example module routes (`examples/modkit/users_info`) and real module routes (`modules/file_parser`).\r\n  ","created_at":"2025-12-16T22:21:09Z","updated_at":"2025-12-19T00:07:24Z","closed_at":"2025-12-19T00:07:24Z","merged_at":"2025-12-19T00:07:24Z","merge_commit_sha":"63fe88c3d36c659d06f180c880dc86b98080686f","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers