}},"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/89"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/89"},"issue":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/89"},"comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/89/comments"},"review_comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/89/comments"},"review_comment":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments{/number}"},"commits":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/89/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/statuses/2189aebc0b2ee44c96c74dcd9b56017a38f07c82"}},"author_association":"MEMBER","auto_merge":null,"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},"source_issue_comments":[],"source_review_comments":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2618872101","pull_request_review_id":3577508241,"id":2618872101,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPaLyBs6cGNEl","diff_hunk":"@@ -57,8 +57,16 @@ fmt:\n # |             | - Missing documentation warnings                                     |\n # |             | - Ensures clean compilation across all targets and features          |\n # +-------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------+\n+# | dylint      | - Project-specific architectural conventions (custom lints)         |\n+# |             | - DTO declaration and placement (only in api/rest folders)           |\n+# |             | - DTO isolation (no references from domain/contract layers)          |\n+# |             | - API endpoint versioning requirements (e.g., /v1/users)            |\n+# |             | - Contract layer purity (no serde, HTTP types, or ToSchema)         |\n+# |             | - Layer separation and dependency rules enforcement                  |\n+# |             | - Use 'make dylint-list' to see all available custom lints          |\n+# +-------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------+\n \n-.PHONY: clippy kani geiger safety lint\n+.PHONY: clippy kani geiger safety lint dylint dylint-list dylint-test","path":"Makefile","commit_id":"2189aebc0b2ee44c96c74dcd9b56017a38f07c82","original_commit_id":"2189aebc0b2ee44c96c74dcd9b56017a38f07c82","user":{"login":"hyphen-2025","id":248559081,"node_id":"U_kgDODtC16Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/248559081?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyphen-2025","html_url":"https://github.com/hyphen-2025","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyphen-2025/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyphen-2025/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyphen-2025/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyphen-2025/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyphen-2025/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyphen-2025/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyphen-2025/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyphen-2025/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyphen-2025/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Will we execute dylint on CI? Will there be a separate PR?","created_at":"2025-12-15T10:37:50Z","updated_at":"2025-12-15T10:37:50Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/89#discussion_r2618872101","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/89","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2618872101"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/89#discussion_r2618872101"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/89"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2618872101/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":69,"original_line":69,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":14,"position":14,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2618910814","pull_request_review_id":3577551064,"id":2618910814,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPaLyBs6cGWhe","diff_hunk":"@@ -0,0 +1,206 @@\n+# Hyperspot Dylint Linters\n+\n+Custom [dylint](https://github.com/trailofbits/dylint) linters enforcing Hyperspot's architectural patterns, layer separation, and REST API conventions.\n+\n+## Quick Start\n+\n+```bash\n+# From workspace root\n+make dylint              # Run lints on workspace (auto-rebuilds if changed)\n+make dylint-list         # Show all available lints\n+make dylint-test         # Test UI cases (compile & verify violations)\n+```\n+\n+## What This Checks\n+\n+**Contract Layer (DE01xx)**\n+- ✅ DE0101: No Serde in Contract\n+- ✅ DE0102: No ToSchema in Contract\n+- ✅ DE0103: No HTTP Types in Contract\n+\n+**API Layer (DE02xx)**\n+- ✅ DE0201: DTOs Only in API Rest Folder\n+- ✅ DE0202: DTOs Not Referenced Outside API\n+- ✅ DE0203: DTOs Must Have Serde Derives\n+- ✅ DE0204: DTOs Must Have ToSchema Derive\n+\n+**REST Conventions (DE08xx)**\n+- ✅ DE0801: API Endpoint Must Have Version\n+\n+## Examples\n+\n+Each lint includes bad/good examples in source comments. View them:\n+\n+```bash\n+# Show lint implementation with examples\n+cat contract_lints/src/de01_contract_layer/de0101_no_serde_in_contract.rs\n+```\n+\n+Example output:\n+\n+```rust\n+//! ## Example: Bad","path":"dylint_lints/README.md","commit_id":"2189aebc0b2ee44c96c74dcd9b56017a38f07c82","original_commit_id":"2189aebc0b2ee44c96c74dcd9b56017a38f07c82","user":{"login":"Bechma","id":19294519,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5