@@\n+# Event Broker Module\n+\n+## Overview\n+\n+The Event Broker is a high-performance event streaming module for HyperSpot. It provides a REST API for producing and\n+consuming events with support for batch operations, cursor-based pagination, and long-polling. Events are typed using\n+the Global Type System (GTS) notation and stored with monotonically increasing sequences for reliable ordering and\n+replay.\n+\n+The module acts as a lightweight event log, enabling decoupled communication between microservices and real-time data\n+streaming use cases.\n+\n+## Architecture\n+\n+The Event Broker follows HyperSpot's modular architecture with clean layer separation:\n+\n+```\n+event_broker/\n+├── src/\n+│   ├── contract/          # Public API (transport-agnostic)\n+│   │   ├── client.rs      # Native Rust client trait (EventBrokerApi)\n+│   │   ├── model.rs       # Core models: Event, Topic, EventType\n+│   │   └── error.rs       # Contract errors: EventBrokerError\n+│   ├── domain/            # Business logic\n+│   │   ├── service.rs     # Event service (produce, consume, storage)\n+│   │   ├── repository.rs  # Repository traits (event persistence)\n+│   │   └── events.rs      # Domain events\n+│   ├── api/               # REST adapters\n+│   │   └── rest/\n+│   │       ├── dto.rs     # REST DTOs (with serde)\n+│   │       ├── handlers.rs # HTTP handlers\n+│   │       ├── routes.rs  # Route registration\n+│   │       ├── mapper.rs  # DTO ↔ Model conversions\n+│   │       └── error.rs   # Problem Details mapping\n+│   ├── infra/             # Infrastructure\n+│   │   └── storage/       # Event storage implementation\n+│   │       ├── repository.rs\n+│   │       └── entity.rs\n+│   ├── gateways/          # Client implementations\n+│   │   └── local.rs       # Local client for ClientHub\n+│   ├── module.rs          # Module registration\n+│   └── config.rs          # Typed configuration\n+└── README.md\n+```\n+\n+### Key Design Principles\n+\n+- **Sequential ordering**: Events are ordered by monotonically increasing sequence numbers\n+- **GTS-typed events**: All events are identified by GTS types identifiers","path":"modules/event_broker/README.md","commit_id":"ef9c07b456b71b18d1375909edb2f130b51b2e31","original_commit_id":"ef9c07b456b71b18d1375909edb2f130b51b2e31","user":{"login":"Artifizer","id":192502778,"node_id":"U_kgDOC3lb-g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/192502778?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer","html_url":"https://github.com/Artifizer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I'd add a link to https://github.com/globalTypeSystem/gts-spec/","created_at":"2025-12-12T09:03:21Z","updated_at":"2025-12-13T00:28:29Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/66#discussion_r2613461816","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/66","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2613461816"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/66#discussion_r2613461816"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/66"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2613461816/reactions","total_count":0,"+1"