8?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer","html_url":"https://github.com/Artifizer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Now `make help` and just `make` work like this. It requires python, but it's already there in dependencies...  \r\n\r\n```\r\n$ make help\r\n\r\nDefaults:\r\n * help                - Show the help message with list of commands (default target)\r\n\r\nCode formatting:\r\n * fmt                 - Check code formatting\r\n\r\nCode safety checks:\r\n * clippy              - Run clippy linter\r\n * safety              - Run all code safety checks\r\n   kani                - The Kani Rust Verifier for checking safety of the code\r\n   geiger              - Run Geiger scanner for unsafe code in dependencies\r\n   lint                - Check there are no compile time warnings\r\n\r\nCode security checks:\r\n * security            - Run all security checks\r\n   deny                - Check licenses and dependencies\r\n\r\nAPI and docs:\r\n * openapi             - Generate OpenAPI spec from running hyperspot-server\r\n\r\nDevelopment and auto fix:\r\n * dev                 - Auto-fix formatting and clippy warnings\r\n   dev-test            - Run tests in development mode\r\n   dev-fmt             - Auto-fix code formatting\r\n   dev-clippy          - Auto-fix clippy warnings\r\n\r\nTests:\r\n * test                - Run all tests\r\n * test-db             - Run all database integration tests\r\n   test-sqlite         - Run SQLite integration tests\r\n   test-pg             - Run PostgreSQL integration tests\r\n   test-mysql          - Run MySQL integration tests\r\n   test-users-info-pg  - Run users_info module integration tests\r\n\r\nE2E tests:\r\n * e2e                 - Run E2E tests in Docker (default)\r\n * e2e-local           - Run E2E tests locally\r\n   e2e-docker          - Run E2E tests in Docker environment\r\n\r\nCode coverage:\r\n * coverage            - Generate code coverage report (unit + e2e-local tests)\r\n * coverage-unit       - Generate code coverage report (unit tests only)\r\n * coverage-e2e-local  - Generate code coverage report (e2e-local tests only)\r\n   check-prereq-e2e-local - Ensure needed packages and programs installed for local e2e testing\r\n\r\nMain targets:\r\n * quickstart          - Start server with quickstart config\r\n * check               - Run all quality checks\r\n * ci                  - Run CI pipeline\r\n * build               - Make a release build using stable toolchain\r\n * all                 - Run all necessary quality checks and tests and then build the release binary\r\n   example             - Run server with example module\r\n\r\nNOTE: '*' marks primary commands in each section; unmarked entries are secondary commands.\r\n\r\nRun 'make build' to build the release binary\r\nRun 'make all' to run all necessary quality checks and tests and then build the release binary\r\n```","created_at":"2025-12-08T21:17:15Z","updated_at":"2025-12-09T16:58:18Z","closed_at":"2025-12-09T16:58:18Z","merged_at":"2025-12-09T16:58:18Z","merge_commit_sha":"8cee8f823ee5ab8ddf1b43c9eb9ff3794163dbd0","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"modcrafter77","id":216291417,"node_id":"U_kgDODORYWQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/216291417?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"http