t/pulls/comments{/number}"},"commits":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/22/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/statuses/63900548b30fbac3db0e787324ed9d2ea9eefe8a"}},"author_association":"MEMBER","auto_merge":null,"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},"source_issue_comments":[],"source_review_comments":[],"source_reviews":[]},{"source_pr_number":21,"source_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/21","source_state":"closed","source_author":"modcrafter77","target_issue_number":null,"title":"[PR #21] [WIP] **feat(secure-orm): ship typestate-based, request-scoped secure ORM w…","status":"exported","mirrored_at":null,"comments_status":"none","comments_mirrored":0,"pr_head_ref":"feature/security-first-step","pr_head_sha":"9234afdd42d5702c4ab942aaa583bb33832f02ae","pr_base_ref":"main","pr_head_owner":"modcrafter77","pr_from_fork":1,"source_data":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/21","id":2929518439,"node_id":"PR_kwDOPaLyBs6unOdn","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/21","diff_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/21.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/21.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/21","number":21,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[WIP] **feat(secure-orm): ship typestate-based, request-scoped secure ORM w…","user":{"login":"modcrafter77","id":216291417,"node_id":"U_kgDODORYWQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/216291417?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/modcrafter77","html_url":"https://github.com/modcrafter77","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/modcrafter77/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/modcrafter77/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/modcrafter77/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/modcrafter77/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/modcrafter77/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/modcrafter77/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/modcrafter77/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/modcrafter77/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/modcrafter77/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"…ith scoped mutations and derive macro**\r\n\r\n### Summary\r\n\r\nFinalize a **secure-by-default** SeaORM layer for `modkit-db` that enforces access control at **compile time** via the **typestate pattern** and uses a **request-scoped** `SecurityCtx`. Adds scoped UPDATE/DELETE helpers and a proc-macro `#[derive(Scopable)]` for zero-boilerplate entity metadata.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Highlights\r\n* New crate is introduced: modkit-security\r\n  * all domain-level security types will live here\r\n\r\n* **Typestate enforcement**\r\n\r\n  * `SecureSelect<E, Unscoped>` → `.scope_with(&AccessScope)?` → `SecureSelect<E, Scoped>`\r\n  * Only `Scoped` exposes `.all/.one` – unscoped execution is impossible at compile time.\r\n* **Implicit policy (deny-by-default)**\r\n\r\n  * Empty scope ⇒ `WHERE 1=0`\r\n  * Tenants ⇒ `tenant_col IN (...)`\r\n  * Resources ⇒ `id IN (...)`\r\n  * Both ⇒ `tenant_col IN (...) AND id IN (...)`\r\n  * Entities **without** tenant column + tenant scope ⇒ deny (safe default).\r\n\r\n* **Request-scoped `SecurityCtx`**\r\n\r\n  * `SecureConn` no longer stores context; all operations accept `&SecurityCtx`.\r\n  * Services stay stateless; handlers pass context per request.\r\n* **Scoped mutations**\r\n\r\n  * `SecureConn::update_with_ctx::<E>(&ctx, id, am)` — refuses update if the row is out of scope.\r\n  * `SecureConn::delete_by_id::<E>(&ctx, id)` — validates scope before deleting.\r\n  * `secure_insert::<E>(ctx, am, conn)` — validates tenant scope for tenant-aware entities (no auto-populate; caller sets fields).\r\n* **Escape hatch (dev/admin only)**\r\n\r\n  * `DbHandle::sea()` is gated behind `insecure-escape` and logs `tracing::warn!` on use.\r\n  * Default path: `DbHandle::sea_secure() -> SecureConn`.\r\n* **Proc-macro: `#[derive(Scopable)]` (crate: `modkit-db-macros`)**\r\n\r\n  * Auto-implements `ScopableEntity` for SeaORM entities.\r\n  * Attributes: `#[secure(tenant_col=\"...\")]`, `#[secure(resource_col=\"...\")]`, `#[secure(owner_col=\"...\")]`, `#[secure(entity=\"CustomEntity\")]`.\r\n  * UI tests included (valid/invalid configs).\r\n\r\n- Add ROOT_TENANT_ID and ROOT_SUBJECT_ID compile-time constants\r\n- Add aliases DEFAULT_TENANT_ID and DEFAULT_USER_ID","created_at":"2025-10-20T11:25:26Z","updated_at":"2025-10-28T12:05:13Z","closed_at":"2025-10-28T12:05:13Z","merged_at":"2025-10-28T12:05:13Z","merge_commit_sha":"fea871c2afde86bad2f476c32e3f0fedc757a877","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/21/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/21/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/21/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/statuses/9234afdd42d5702c4ab942aaa583bb33832f02ae","head":{"label":"modcrafter77:feature/security-first-step","ref":"feature/security-first-step","sha":"9234afdd42d5702c4ab942aaa583bb33832f02ae","user":{"login":"modcrafter77","id":216291417,"node_id":"U_kgDODORYWQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/216291417?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/modcrafter77","html_url":"https://github.com/modcrafter77","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/modcrafter77/followers","follo