,"original_commit_id":"16e1a8457f21d873bbe736be83f4900dfdb69843","user":{"login":"modcrafter77","id":216291417,"node_id":"U_kgDODORYWQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/216291417?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/modcrafter77","html_url":"https://github.com/modcrafter77","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/modcrafter77/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/modcrafter77/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/modcrafter77/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/modcrafter77/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/modcrafter77/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/modcrafter77/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/modcrafter77/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/modcrafter77/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/modcrafter77/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"We have two options:\r\n1. Do not include it into OpenAPI description\r\n2. Invent something to declare somehow this meta information:\r\n```Rust\r\nstatic USER_FMAP .... {\r\n    odata::FieldMap::<UserEntity>::new()\r\n        .insert(\"id\", Column::Id, odata::FieldKind::Uuid)\r\n        .insert(\"email\", Column::Email, odata::FieldKind::String)\r\n        .insert(\"created_at\",\r\n            Column::CreatedAt,\r\n            odata::FieldKind::DateTimeUtc,\r\n        )\r\n});\r\n```\r\nin routes/Open API definitions.\r\n\r\nBut I see two issues in #2:\r\n1. Abstraction leakage because we need to specify underlying DB type in Open API layer\r\n2. We need to pass this information between all layers\r\n","created_at":"2025-09-19T13:59:51Z","updated_at":"2025-09-19T13:59:51Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/11#discussion_r2362989690","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/11","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2362989690"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/11#discussion_r2362989690"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/11"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2362989690/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":27,"original_line":27,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2361990935,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":20,"position":20,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2362996931","pull_request_review_id":3245029080,"id":2362996931,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPaLyBs6M2HjD","diff_hunk":"@@ -19,5 +20,10 @@ pub trait UsersRepository: Send + Sync {\n     /// Delete by id. Returns true if a row was deleted.\n     async fn delete(&self, id: Uuid) -> anyhow::Result<bool>;\n     /// List with simple pagination.\n-    async fn list_paginated(&self, limit: u32, offset: u32) -> anyhow::Result<Vec<User>>;\n+    async fn list_paginated(\n+        &self,\n+        filter: ODataFilter,","path":"examples/modkit/users_info/src/domain/repo.rs","commit_id":"16e1a8457f21d873bbe736be83f4900dfdb69843","original_commit_id":"16e1a8457f21d873bbe736be83f4900dfdb69843","user":{"login":"modcrafter77","id":216291417,"node_id":"U_kgDODORYWQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/216291417?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/modcrafter77","html_url":"https://github.com/modcrafter77","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/modcrafter77/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/modcrafter77/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/modcrafter77/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"