Artifizer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Maybe we can keep just limit and offset for now, until we see real demand for OData in local calls","created_at":"2025-09-19T19:51:02Z","updated_at":"2025-09-19T19:51:02Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/11#discussion_r2364374541","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/11","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2364374541"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/11#discussion_r2364374541"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/11"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2364374541/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":36,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2362003721,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":13,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"}],"source_reviews":[]},{"source_pr_number":10,"source_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/10","source_state":"closed","source_author":"modcrafter77","target_issue_number":null,"title":"[PR #10] feat: implement new ModKit DB Handling model with per-module DB configuration","status":"exported","mirrored_at":null,"comments_status":"none","comments_mirrored":0,"pr_head_ref":"feature/db_config","pr_head_sha":"844549f19203c55c7f0b230aae533dc053f08fa1","pr_base_ref":"main","pr_head_owner":"modcrafter77","pr_from_fork":1,"source_data":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/10","id":2826827032,"node_id":"PR_kwDOPaLyBs6offUY","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/10","diff_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/10.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/10.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/10","number":10,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat: implement new ModKit DB Handling model with per-module DB configuration","user":{"login":"modcrafter77","id":216291417,"node_id":"U_kgDODORYWQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/216291417?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/modcrafter77","html_url":"https://github.com/modcrafter77","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/modcrafter77/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/modcrafter77/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/modcrafter77/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/modcrafter77/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/modcrafter77/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/modcrafter77/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/modcrafter77/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/modcrafter77/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/modcrafter77/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"…ation\r\n\r\nBREAKING CHANGES:\r\n- Replace monolithic database config with typed per-module configuration system\r\n- Environment variable expansion is implemented for DB passwords (`${VAR}` syntax)\r\n- Update ModuleCtx API: db() returns references, add config<T>() and raw_config() methods\r\n\r\n### Major Features Added:\r\n- **New Typed Configuration System**:\r\n  - `GlobalDatabaseConfig`: Server-based configuration with auto-provisioning\r\n  - `DbConnConfig`: Reusable connection config for global servers and modules\r\n  - `PoolCfg`: Connection pool configuration with human-readable durations\r\n  - `ModuleEntry`: Structured module configuration with database and config sections\r\n\r\n- **Per-Module Database Handling**:\r\n  - `build_final_db_for_module()`: Core precedence resolution engine\r\n  - `PerModuleDbFactory`: Dynamic database provisioning for modules\r\n  - Four-layer precedence: Global DSN → Global fields → Module DSN → Module fields\r\n  - SQLite path resolution (file/path/default) with cross-platform support\r\n\r\n- **Enhanced Environment Integration**:\r\n  - `expand_env_in_dsn()`: ${VARNAME} expansion in DSN strings\r\n  - `resolve_password()`: Handles both literal passwords and ${VAR} references\r\n  - `validate_dsn()`: DSN validation using dsn crate\r\n\r\n- **ModKit Runtime Integration**:\r\n  - Updated `ModuleCtx` API with new db(), config<T>(), raw_config() methods\r\n  - Enhanced module registry with per-module DB factory support\r\n  - Conditional compilation for runtime-dependent features","created_at":"2025-09-14T15:25:54Z","updated_at":"2025-09-27T23:05:37Z","closed_at":"2025-09-27T23:05:37Z","merged_at":"2025-09-27T23:05:37Z","merge_commit_sha":"dd180e0d9a3e6cd559e69521a37e8aa4f06cec91","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/10/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/10/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/c