","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/modcrafter77/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/modcrafter77/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/modcrafter77/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/modcrafter77/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/modcrafter77/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/modcrafter77/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/modcrafter77/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/modcrafter77/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"feat: add Server-Sent Events (SSE) support to modkit with OpenAPI integration\r\n- Add SseBroadcaster<T> in modkit/http/sse.rs for type-safe SSE broadcasting\r\n  * Built on tokio::sync::broadcast with configurable buffer size\r\n  * JSON event serialization with graceful error handling\r\n  * Automatic keepalive pings (15-second intervals)\r\n  * Stream-based API compatible with axum::response::sse\r\n\r\n- Extend OperationBuilder with .sse_json<T>() methods\r\n  * Support for both initial and additional SSE responses\r\n  * Automatic schema registration for event types\r\n  * Type-safe: requires T: ToSchema + PartialSchema\r\n\r\n- Update OpenAPI generator to document text/event-stream endpoints\r\n  * Treat SSE as JSON-like content for schema references\r\n  * Proper OpenAPI documentation with event payload schemas\r\n  * Comprehensive test coverage for SSE OpenAPI generation\r\n\r\n- Add timeout override support for long-lived SSE connections\r\n  * Per-route timeout configuration via MethodRouter\r\n  * Example shows 1-hour timeout vs 30s global default\r\n  \r\n  - users_info sample is updated for new SSE feature using","created_at":"2025-09-09T23:50:08Z","updated_at":"2025-09-10T22:17:19Z","closed_at":"2025-09-10T22:17:19Z","merged_at":"2025-09-10T22:17:19Z","merge_commit_sha":"428c3faf88b4cf12e66ea15